--TEST--
an enum a class declares is the same kind of name as one declared at file scope, so its name and its cases carry the same token types, `rule:enums/class-scoped-enum`, `rule:ide/semantic-tokens-carry-the-qualifiers`
--FILE--
<?nvs
class Order {
    enum Status {
        Draft,
        Paid = 4,
    }
}
--REQUEST--
semanticTokens
--EXPECT--
2:7+5 class
3:10+6 enum
4:9+5 enumMember
5:9+4 enumMember
